   871	 * Function: wlan_dopoll
   872	 *
   873	 * Description:
   874	 *   The function is called in order to perform an out-of-sequence TX poll.
   875	 *   This is done:
   876	 *
   877	 *   1. When new TX data is available (wlan_txavail)
   878	 *   2. After a TX timeout to restart the sending process
   879	 *      (wlan_txtimeout_expiry).
