100--
101--  /*
102:-   * On this NuttX/OpenVela shell, system("mediad &") may return -1 even when
103:-   * the background mediad task was successfully created.  The runtime log
104:-   * then shows "mediad [pid:prio]" and Media graph initialization.
105--   *
106--   * Therefore the system() return value is not a reliable launch-success
107--   * signal for a background NSH command.  Mark the one-shot launch as claimed
108--   * before calling system() so set_voice_tts cannot start a second daemon while
109--   * the first one is booting.
110--   */
