60-- *
61:- * Do not start mediad from voice_channel_init() and do not poll wlan0 while
62-- * set_wifi is associating / obtaining DHCP.
63-- *
64-- * Media follows the same lazy one-shot lifecycle style as the OLED: the first
65-- * eligible caller performs initialization, and all later callers reuse it.  In the normal vela> workflow:
66-- *
67-- *   set_wifi ...
68-- *     -> Wi-Fi/DHCP completes
69-- *   set_voice_asr ...   (or set_voice_tts ...)
70:- *     -> robot_media_runtime_init_once()
71:- *     -> mediad &
72-- *     -> IPC startup grace
73-- *   ask ...
74-- *
75-- * This gives Media time to become ready before the first ask, including the
76-- * official "播放" NL fast-path which can reach music_play before the normal
77-- * outbound "working" / OLED status is emitted.
78-- *
79-- * network_is_connected() is queried once at the trigger point.  There is no
80-- * background polling and contest code does not modify wlan0.
81-- */
