/**************************************************************************************
 * Function:    MP3Decode
 *
 * Description: decode one frame of MP3 data
 *
 * Inputs:      valid MP3 decoder instance pointer (HMP3Decoder)
 *              double pointer to buffer of MP3 data (containing headers + mainData)
