   1	# Music DJ
   2	
   3	Own direct music requests in the contest build while keeping the official
   4	music tool interface. The companion reaction for confirmed playback is handled
   5	by `robot-music-companion` after the proactive observer reports the state.
   6	
   7	## When to use
   8	
