  10	change the volume of music, including 下一首/上一首/换一首/切歌/skip/next.
  11	
  12	## How to use
  13	
  14	1. Parse the request as play, pause, resume, stop, volume, seek, status, or
  15	   skip.
  16	2. For a play request without a URL, call `music_search` once and choose the
  17	   first suitable result.
  18	3. Call `music_play` with the selected URL.
  19	4. For pause, resume, stop, seek, volume, and status requests, call the
  20	   matching music tool.
  21	5. Keep the confirmation short so TTS does not interrupt the beginning of the
  22	   song.
  23	
  24	After `music_play` succeeds, do not call a second music Skill and do not repeat
  25	the music tool. The contest music observer will report the confirmed playing
  26	state and `robot-music-companion` will perform one expression reaction and,
  27	when safe, one default tail wag. If `music_play` fails, report the failure and
