 85\t## Example\n    86\tUser: \"示例输入\"\n    87\t→ web_search \"query\"\n    88\t→ \"示例回复\"\n    89\t```\n    90\t\n    91\t### 最佳实践\n    92\t\n    93\t- 保持简洁（占用 context 窗口）\n    94\t- 指定具体工具名（`web_search` 而非\"搜索\"）\n    95\t- When to use 要精确，避免误触发\n    96\t- 一个 Skill 一个职责\n    97\t- 用 Example 降低歧义\n    98\t\n    99\t### 可用工具\n   100\t\n   101\tSkill 中可引用 35+ 种内置工具和 MCP 注册的外部工具。完整列表见 [tools.md](tools.md)。\n     1\t# AI Agent Skills\n     2\t\n     3\tAI Agent 内置 Skill 的 Markdown 源文件。设备启动时自动安装到 `/data/agent/skills/`。\n     4\t\n     5\t## 目录\n     6\t\n     7\t| 分类 | Skill | 工具链 |\n     8\t|------|-------|--------|\n     9\t| 天气 | weather | get_current_time → web_search |\n    10\t| 简报 | daily-briefing | get_current_time → read_file → web_search → cron_list |\n    11\t| 新闻 | news-digest | get_current_time → news_search → web_search |\n    12\t| 健康 | health-monitor | get_heartrate → get_steps → get_wear_state |\n    13\t| 运动 | exercise-coach | get_steps → get_heartrate → get_current_time → cron_add |\n    14\t| 电池 | battery-advisor | get_battery → get_current_time |\n    15\t| 诊断 | device-diagnostics | get_battery → get_screen_state → get_wear_state → run_shell |\n    16\t| 提醒 | reminder | get_current_time → cron_add |\n    17\t| 笔记 | note-taker | get_current_time → read_file → write_file/edit_file |\n    18\t| 任务 | task-manager | read_file → get_current_time → edit_file/write_file |\n    19\t| 翻译 | translate | 语言知识 → web_search（术语验证） |\n    20\t| 会议 | meeting-notes | get_current_time → feishu_doc_create → feishu_doc_write |\n    21\t| 通知 | team-notify | feishu_chat_members → feishu_send_mention |\n    22\t| 文档 | doc-search | feishu_doc_list → feishu_doc_read |\n    23\t| 音乐 | music-dj | music_play → music_set_volume → music_status |\n    24\t| 助眠 | sleep-music | music_play → music_set_volume → cron_add(music_stop) |\n    25\t| 紧急 | sos-alert | vibrate → get_current_time → feishu_send_mention |\n    26\t| 调研 | deep-research | web_search → fetch_url → write_file |\n   