 *
 * No resampling and no time-domain sample repetition are performed.
 * Each mono source sample is left-aligned into one 32-bit mono I2S word:
 *
 *   source: A B C ...
 *   wire:   (A<<16) (B<<16) (C<<16) ...
 *
